# Approach to Gram Negative Cocci

- **Medically important G- cocci:**
  - <u>Moraxella catarrhalis</u> - a/w acute H&N infections (e.g. otitis media, acute bacterial rhinosinusitis)
  - <u>Neisseria species</u>:
    - N. gonorrhoea - a/w gonorrhoea and extragenital manifestations
    - N. meningitidis - a/w bacterial meningitis and meningococcemia
